# GOV-05：跨平台归一（Windows 开发 + ubuntu CI 跑 fmt/lint）。
# 文本文件统一 LF 入库；Windows 侧编辑器经 .editorconfig 对齐，杜绝 CRLF 噪声 diff 与 fmt 抖动。

* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 专属文件保持 CRLF（工具链自身要求）
*.bat    text eol=crlf
*.cmd    text eol=crlf
*.ps1    text eol=crlf
*.nsh    text eol=crlf

# 二进制（防止 diff/合并破坏）
*.ico    binary
*.png    binary
*.jpg    binary
*.gif    binary
*.woff   binary
*.woff2  binary
*.zip    binary
*.exe    binary
*.dll    binary

# 生成物不入 diff 噪声
Cargo.lock text eol=lf
package-lock.json text eol=lf
